'''Cracked deepslate tiles''' are a cracked variant of [[deepslate tiles]].

== Obtaining ==
=== Breaking ===
Cracked deepslate tiles can be obtained only by mining it with a [[pickaxe]]. When mined using any other tool, it drops nothing. Mining cracked deepslate tiles takes longer than mining [[deepslate]].
{{breaking row|Cracked Deepslate Tiles|Pickaxe|Wood|horizontal=1}}

=== Natural generation ===
Cracked deepslate tiles generate naturally in [[ancient cities]].

=== Smelting ===
{{Smelting
|showname=1
|Deepslate Tiles
|Cracked Deepslate Tiles
|0.1
}}

== Usage ==
Cracked deepslate tiles is a decorative block and is not used in any crafting or smelting recipes.
=== Note blocks ===
Cracked deepslate tiles can be placed under [[note block]]s to produce "bass drum" sounds.

=== Sulfur cube ===
{{In development|section=1|drop=Chaos Cubed}}
[[Sulfur cube]]s have the ability to absorb cracked deepslate tiles, either through picking them up or being interacted with them. This provides the regular/football effect to the mob when hitting it.

